---
import Section from "@components/Section.astro";
import Button from "@components/Button.astro";
---

<div data-section="about">
  <Section
    heading="Let me introduce myself."
    icon="HandWaving"
    headingGap="small"
    id="about"
    class="bg-about pt-24"
  >
    <div class="relative flex flex-col gap-10">
      <div
        class="p4-regular rich-text rich-text-about w-full text-blue-100 opacity-90 lg:w-9/12"
      >
        <p>
          Hi, my name is Davide Wölckner and I'm a software engineer based in
          Ticino (southern Switzerland) with a particular interest in the web,
          frontend engineering and UI/UX design.
        </p>
        <p>
          I have a bachelor's degree in Computer Science and a master's degree
          in Software and Data Engineering, both acquired at USI (Università
          della Svizzera italiana) in Lugano (Switzerland). I'm currently
          working as a frontend/fullstack engineer at Duferco (Lugano).
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm a creative and dynamic person that enjoys working on projects that
          can be useful to people on a daily basis, making their life and work
          easier, quicker and more organized. Most of my personal projects have
          also been created for this purpose, as I often find myself wishing for
          tools that can boost my productivity.
        </p>
        <p>
          I've recently been enjoying using TypeScript, Next.js, Svelte, Sanity
          and Tailwind a lot.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Button href="/davide_ciulla_cv.pdf" external>Look at my resume</Button>
      <div
        class="group outline-turquoise-200/6 absolute top-0 right-0 hidden h-105 w-73.75 -rotate-[5.4deg] rounded-2xl mix-blend-lighten outline transition-transform duration-300 hover:-rotate-[4deg] lg:block"
      >
        <div
          class="bg-about-img absolute top-0 left-0 z-10 h-full w-full transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-80"
        >
        </div>
        <img
          src="/images/about.png"
          alt="Davide Wölckner"
          class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-full rounded-2xl bg-cover object-cover opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-80"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</div>

<style>
  .rich-text-about :global(a) {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .rich-text-about :global(a:hover) {
    color: var(--color-grayscale-100);
  }
</style>
